Conclusion: For real-time tweet tracking by keyword worldwide, the **twitter-streaming** API is the primary under social category. For displaying these tweets on a map, one or more mapping APIs (e.g. bing-maps, google-maps-places, mapbox, openstreetmap) will be essential.

